/** 结构说明（自动提取）：findNavigationPath；输入 regionEntity、start、goal、entities、agentRadius、nowMilliseconds；直接调用 regionEntity.getComponent、every、performance.now、region.polygon.map、pointInOrOnPolygon 等；写入 navigationProfile.lastQueryMilliseconds、navigationProfile.maximumQueryMilliseconds、grid；返回路径包含 path；包含循环处理。 */ function findNavigationPath(regionEntity: Entity, start: Vec2, goal: Vec2, entities: Entity[], agentRadius?: number, nowMilliseconds = performance.now()): Vec2[] {
